":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P090-S1-Q03","number":3,"question":"25.07.13 한국토지주택공사 (트리피) · 객관식 3번","searchText":" 03\n\n반지름이 mm인 평행 왕복도선의 간격이 2m일 때,\n\n평행 왕복도선 사이의 정전용량Fm은?\n\n\n                              \n①            ②ln×  ln× \n                              \n③            ④ln×  ln× \n        \n⑤ln× ","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.07.13 한국토지주택공사 (트리피)","originalId":"2025p2-e12-m03","number":3},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e12-m03-q.webp","width":678,"height":533},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e12-m03-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1630}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P090-S1-Q04","number":4,"question":"25.07.13 한국토지주택공사 (트리피) · 객관식 4번","searchText":" 04\n\n자로의 길이 m, 투자율이 Hm인 철심의 자기저항\n이 × AT일 때, 철심의 단면적mm은?\n\n\n① 1           ② 2\n\n③ 3           ④ 4\n\n⑤ 5","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.07.13 한국토지주택공사 (트리피)","originalId":"2025p2-e12-m04","number":4},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e12-m04-q.webp","width":696,"height":527},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e12-m04-e1.webp","width":678,"height":252}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P090-S1-Q05","number":5,"question":"25.07.13 한국토지주택공사 (트리피) · 객관식 5번","searchText":" 05\n\n동심 구도체의 내도체 반지름이 m, 외도체 반지름이\n\nm일 때, 내도체와 외도체 사이에 대한 저항 Ω은?\n(단, 는 고유저항Ω･m이다.)\n\n\n                          \n①           ② \n\n                        \n③           ④ \n\n   \n⑤ ","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.07.13 한국토지주택공사 (트리피)","originalId":"2025p2-e12-m05","number":5},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e12-m05-q.webp","width":696,"height":617},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e12-m05-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1021}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P090-S1-Q06","number":6,"question":"25.07.13 한국토지주택공사 (트리피) · 객관식 6번","searchText":" 06\n\n같은 방향으로 감긴 두 코일이 직렬로 접속되어 있다.\n\n코일 1의 자기 인덕턴스가 0.02H , 권선수가 150, 코일\n2의 권수가 600일 때, 코일2의 자기 인덕턴스 H 와\n\n상호 인덕턴스 H은? (단, 결합계수는 1이다.)\n\n\n             H             H \n\n ①          0.32                  0.08\n\n ②          0.32                  0.06\n\n ③          0.16                  0.04\n\n ④          0.16                  0.02\n\n ⑤          0.08                  0.01","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.07.13 한국토지주택공사 (트리피)","originalId":"2025p2-e12-m06","number":6},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e12-m06-q.webp","width":696,"height":692},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e12-m06-e1.webp","width":696,"height":861},{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e12-m06-e2.webp","width":678,"height":496}],"responseType"