식 11번","searchText":" 11\n\n설비용량이 500kW, 수용률이 0.8, 부하율이 0.5일 때,\n\n최대수용전력kW은?\n\n\n① 250         ② 320\n\n③ 400         ④ 420\n\n⑤ 480","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.07.13 한국토지주택공사 (트리피)","originalId":"2025p2-e12-m11","number":11},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e12-m11-q.webp","width":696,"height":563},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e12-m11-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1676}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P090-S1-Q12","number":12,"question":"25.07.13 한국토지주택공사 (트리피) · 객관식 12번","searchText":" 12\n\n역률이 저하된 계통에서는 전력용 콘덴서를 병렬로 접속하여\n\n무효전력을 보상한다. 전력용 콘덴서의 용량이 과다하여\n\n과보상이 되는 경우에 나타나는 현상으로 옳지 않은 것은?\n\n\n① 모선전압이 상승    ② 고조파 왜곡의 증대\n\n③ 역률의 저하      ④ 자기여자 현상 발생\n\n⑤ 설비용량의 여유 증대","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.07.13 한국토지주택공사 (트리피)","originalId":"2025p2-e12-m12","number":12},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e12-m12-q.webp","width":696,"height":677},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e12-m12-e1.webp","width":678,"height":206},{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e12-m12-e2.webp","width":696,"height":743}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P090-S1-Q13","number":13,"question":"25.07.13 한국토지주택공사 (트리피) · 객관식 13번","searchText":" 13\n\n저압 네트워크의 장점으로 옳지 않은 것은?\n\n\n① 신뢰도가 높다.\n\n② 기기의 이용률이 높다.\n\n③ 전압강하가 작다.\n\n④ 인축의 접촉이 없어서 사고의 위험이 낮다.\n\n⑤ 변전소의 수를 줄일 수 있다.","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.07.13 한국토지주택공사 (트리피)","originalId":"2025p2-e12-m13","number":13},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e12-m13-q.webp","width":678,"height":643},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e12-m13-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1141}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P090-S1-Q14","number":14,"question":"25.07.13 한국토지주택공사 (트리피) · 객관식 14번","searchText":" 14\n\n감속재로 사용할 수 없는 것은?\n\n\n① 경수         ② 중수\n\n③ 흑연         ④ 산화베릴륨\n\n⑤ 산화마그네슘","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.07.13 한국토지주택공사 (트리피)","originalId":"2025p2-e12-m14","number":14},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e12-m14-q.webp","width":678,"height":563},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e12-m14-e1.webp","width":678,"height":743}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P090-S1-Q15","number":15,"question":"25.07.13 한국토지주택공사 (트리피) · 객관식 15번","searchText":" 15\n\n유기기전력이 270V, 단자전압이 230V인 3상 비돌극형\n\n동기발전기의 전기자저항이 0.1Ω, 동기 리액턴스가 15\n\nΩ, 유기기전력과 단자전압간의 위상차가 30°일 때, 동기\n\n발전기의 3상 출력W은?\n\n\n① 10756        ② 10350\n\n③ 8280         ④ 7464\n\n⑤ 6210","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.07.13 한국토지주택공사 (트리피)","originalId":"2025p2-e12-m15","number":15},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e12-m15-q.webp","width":678,"height":677},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e12-m15-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1139}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P090-S1-Q16","number":16,"question":"25.07.13 한국토지주택공사 (트리피) · 객관식 16번","searchText":" 16\n\n전기자 반작용을 이용하여 중성축에 대해 수직방향으로 유\n\n기되는 기전력을 이용하여 계자전류를 자체 공급하는 자기\n\n여자형 직류발전기로, 부하단자의 와 의 접속을 바\n\n꾸면 계자전류가 차단되어 출력이 즉시 사라지는 기기는?\n\n\n① 발전동기       ② 회전증폭기\n\n③ 로젠베리크 발전기   ④ 제3브러시 발전기\n\n⑤ 전기동력계","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.07.13 한국토지주택공사 (트리피)","originalId":"2025p2-e12-m16","number":16},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e12-m16-q.webp","width":696,"height":603},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e12-m16-e1.webp","width":696,"height":588}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P090-S1-Q17","number":17,"question":"25.07.13 한국토지주택공사 (트리피) · 객관식 17번","searchText":" 17\n\n2000/200V, 50kVA 단상변압기의 2차측 기준으로\n\n환산한 등가저항이 0.1Ω, 등가리액턴스가 0.5Ω, 지상\n\n역률이 0.8일 때, 단상변압기의 전압변동률은?\n\n\n① 37.5         ② 42.5\n\n③ 47.5         ④ 52.5\n\n⑤ 57.5","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.07.13 한국토지주택공사 (트리피)","originalId":"2025p2-e12-m17","number":17},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e12-m17-q.webp","width":696,"height":603},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e12-m17-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1294}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P090-S1-Q18","number":18,"question":"25.07.13 한국토지주택공사 (트리피) · 객관식 18번","searchText":" 18\n\n전기자 총 도체수가 250, 극수가 8, 매 극당 자속 0.7\n\n인 직류 중권 전동기의 전기자 전류가 10A 일 때, 전동\n\n기의 토크는 약 몇 N･m인가?\n\n\n① 269         ② 279\n\n③ 289         ④ 299\n\n⑤ 309","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.07.13 한국토지주택공사 (트리피)","originalId":"2025p2-e12-m18","number":18},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e12-m18-q.webp","width":696,"height":677},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e12-m18-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1881}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P090-S1-Q19","number":19,"question":"25.07.13 한국토지주택공사 (트리피) · 객관식 19번","searchText":" 19\n\n2000/220V, 250kVA인 단상 변압기에서 무부하인\n\n상태에서 소비되는 전력이 750W, 자화전류가 0.6A일\n\n때, 1차 전류A 는?\n\n\n\n\n① 0.671        ② 0.71\n\n③ 0.77         ④ 0.825\n\n⑤ 0.89","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.07.13 한국토지주택공사 (트리피)","originalId":"2025p2-e12-m19","number":19},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e12-m19-q.webp","width":678,"height":603},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e